# Protected paths

Do not edit these paths. That includes the guard, its tests, the allow-list at `src/fixes/allow-list.ts`, the Terraform module, workflows, and these rules.

If the task seems to need a change here, stop. Say that in the pull request description. Do not add the `guard-change` label.
